flowchart TD
  REG["Allowlisted official source registry"] --> FETCH["HTTPS retrieval with retries"]
  FETCH --> OK{"Successful, trusted bytes?"}
  OK -->|Yes| HASH["Content SHA256 and metadata snapshot"]
  OK -->|No| CACHE["Inspect source cache by document ID and hash"]
  CACHE --> VALID{"Acceptable verified cached copy?"}
  VALID -->|Yes| HASH
  VALID -->|No| FAIL["retrieval_failed with complete diagnostics"]
  HASH --> PARSE["PDF/XLSX/API extraction and coordinates"]
  PARSE --> QA["Source table and cell verification"]
  QA --> FACT["Immutable official reference fact"]
  FACT --> VERSION["Version, release precedence and conflicts"]
  VERSION --> REF["Reference set for semantic comparison"]
